{
  "statement": "As the TrustworthinessAgent, I support the importance of safety while emphasizing the need for robust data protection measures. I acknowledge the synthesis proposed by the ResponsibilityAgent regarding RES-06. However, I propose that any relaxation of smoothness constraints during critical maneuvers must also include provisions to ensure that user data remains protected and that logging is conducted in a way that complies with TRU-01 and TRU-03. This ensures that safety measures do not compromise our commitment to data security and integrity.",
  "conflicts_raised": [
    {
      "ids": ["SAF-01", "TRU-01"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "The multi-layer safety architecture may not sufficiently account for data protection measures, risking data security during safety operations."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["SAF-03", "TRU-03"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "Continuous monitoring for ODD compliance may require logging that conflicts with data privacy requirements."
    }
